  "description": "CSV.Net is a lightweight and flexible .NET library for serializing and deserializing objects to and from CSV files. It supports both reading and writing CSV files with customizable delimiters and the ability to handle different data types such as strings, numbers, and dates. The library makes it easy to convert your objects to a CSV format and back, while maintaining the proper mappings and type conversions.",
